								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>A short incremental game where you collect fish for your lab. Synced to music.</strong></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>100,000 fish on screen</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Hover your cursor over fish to collect on the beat. Use a variety of tools to collect as many fish as you can.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/518fdd98e661bcc8e9e9c1d3ed491f51.poster.avif?t=1789401717" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/518fdd98e661bcc8e9e9c1d3ed491f51.webm?t=1789401717" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/518fdd98e661bcc8e9e9c1d3ed491f51.mp4?t=1789401717" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/8b741e519bf6e2d8b7fc2b27ede15165.poster.avif?t=1789401717" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/8b741e519bf6e2d8b7fc2b27ede15165.webm?t=1789401717" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/8b741e519bf6e2d8b7fc2b27ede15165.mp4?t=1789401717" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>The lab gets huge</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every fish you collect earns you money. As you play the lab automatically grows.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/e1da34c98280ecd142da397fff8eeab8.poster.avif?t=1789401717" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/e1da34c98280ecd142da397fff8eeab8.webm?t=1789401717" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/e1da34c98280ecd142da397fff8eeab8.mp4?t=1789401717" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Choose how to power your tools</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Decide which tools get extra power.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/1e9dc84fbabf9728e36c4959149a8f6c.poster.avif?t=1789401717" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/1e9dc84fbabf9728e36c4959149a8f6c.webm?t=1789401717" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/1e9dc84fbabf9728e36c4959149a8f6c.mp4?t=1789401717" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Upgrade your lab and equipment</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Write grants to unlock big equipment upgrades on top of the 200+ upgrades in the tech tree.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/20d6d04871cd51b2a5982a3ed29ba7db.poster.avif?t=1789401717" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/20d6d04871cd51b2a5982a3ed29ba7db.webm?t=1789401717" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/extras/20d6d04871cd51b2a5982a3ed29ba7db.mp4?t=1789401717" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Extra Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Sandbox</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Endless</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Zen - installable as a real Windows screensaver</p></li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					No AI-generated images and I made all the music by hand. Some text may be translated with AI.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
